    "problemStatement": "You are given an array AAA consisting of NNN integers. You have to answer QQQ queries of the following two types:\n\n\n\n111 LLL RRR (R&gt;L)(R &gt; L)(R&gt;L) which asks you to find gcd⁡(AL,lcm(AL+1,gcd⁡(AL+2,...,((R−L) mod 2==1?\\gcd(A_L, lcm(A_{L + 1}, \\gcd(A_{L + 2}, ... , ((R - L) \\bmod 2 == 1 ? gcd(AL​,lcm(AL+1​,gcd(AL+2​,...,((R−L)mod2==1? gcd⁡(AR−1,AR):lcm(AR−1,AR))…)))\\gcd(A_{R - 1}, A_{R}) : lcm(A_{R - 1}, A_{R}))\\ldots)))gcd(AR−1​,AR​):lcm(AR−1​,AR​))…))).\n\n\n\n\n222 LLL RRR (R&gt;L)(R &gt; L)(R&gt;L) which asks you to find the same as above but lcmlcmlcm swapped with gcd⁡\\gcdgcd and vice-versa.\n\n\n\nHere lcm(a,b)lcm(a, b)lcm(a,b) and gcd⁡(a,b)\\gcd(a, b)gcd(a,b) denotes the least common multiple and greatest common divisor of two integers aaa and bbb respectively.\n\n**Example:** Consider the array AAA = [2,4,8,16,32,64][2, 4, 8, 16, 32, 64][2,4,8,16,32,64].\n\n\n\nSuppose a query is of the form 111 111 666, so it asks you to find:\ngcd⁡(2,lcm(4,gcd⁡(8,lcm(16,gcd⁡(32,64)))))\\gcd(2, lcm(4, \\gcd(8, lcm(16, \\gcd(32, 64)))))gcd(2,lcm(4,gcd(8,lcm(16,gcd(32,64))))).\n\n\n\n\nSuppose a query is of the form 222 111 555, so it asks you to find:\nlcm(2,gcd⁡(4,lcm(8,gcd⁡(16,32))))lcm(2, \\gcd(4, lcm(8, \\gcd(16, 32))))lcm(2,gcd(4,lcm(8,gcd(16,32)))).\n\n\n\n**Note:** Since input-output is large, prefer using fast input-output methods.\n\n\nInput Format\n\nThe first line of the input contains a single integer TTT denoting the number of test cases. The description of TTT test cases follows.\nEach testcase contains Q+2Q + 2Q+2 lines of input.\nThe first line of each test case contains two space-separated integers, NNN and QQQ.\nThe second line of each test case contains NNN space-separated integers A1,A2,…,ANA_1, A_2, \\ldots, A_NA1​,A2​,…,AN​.\nQQQ lines follow. For each valid iii, the ithi^{th}ith of these lines contains three space-separated integers Typei,Li,RiType_i, L_i, R_iTypei​,Li​,Ri​, denoting the type and parameters of the ithi^{th}ith query.\n\n\nOutput Format\nFor each query, output in a single line answer to the problem.",
